    LLM: 'Game: Asserufen Schafkopf. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Asserufen Schafkopf (Ace-calling Schafkopf) is a four-player variant of PfÃ¤lzer Schafkopf. The game announcer calls an ace of a suit to choose a partner; the holder of that ace is the teammate but stays hidden until playing the called ace. In calling games hearts (Herz) is trump. Uses French-suited cards. Caller leads; when the called suit is led, the holder must play the called ace if possible (Unten Raus). Solo options also exist.',
    objective: "Caller's side aims to make the contract; called ace identifies partner when played.",
    gameplay: "Announcer calls an ace (suit and rank); that suit's ace holder is partner. Hearts are trump in calling games. Follow suit; when the called suit is led, holder must play the called ace if able (Unten Raus). Solo variants: declarer plays alone. Standard Schafkopf trick and point scoring.",
